SUMMARY:PowerPoint Comedy Club 
DESCRIPTION:What do a New Yorker Cartoonist\, a Sperm Scientist\, a Chemica
 l Engineer\, and an Economist all have in common?&nbsp\;In this particular
  case\, they are all professional comedians\, and are excited to bring you
  a night of PowerPoint comedy at the Olio Lighthouse.&nbsp\;Hosted by Luke
  Strathmann\, who some of you know from his Beanie Babies presentation at 
 Obsession Night\, four of NYC’s best comedians who promise they are real
 ly good at computers will each make funny PowerPoint presentations about w
 hatever they want. Who’s going to be there?Asher Perlman is an Emmy-winn
 ing\, WGA Award-winning\, Peabody Award-winning comedian\, writer\, cartoo
 nist\, and best-selling author. Until recently\, he was a writer/performer
  on The Late Show with Stephen Colbert\, and is currently a cartoonist at 
 The New Yorker\, a performer with the Improvised Shakespeare Company\, and
  a touring comic.Website: https://ashermaxperlman.comIG: https://www.insta
 gram.com/asherperlman/?hl=enShafi Hossain is a nationally touring comedian
 \, and currently the funniest chemical engineer in the world. He has made 
 his TV appearance on Kevin Hart's LOL Network's show Road Comics -currentl
 y streaming on Peacock. Shafi was named one of New York's Funniest Stand U
 p by the New York Comedy Festival. He has over 140K social media following
  and is a regular at the world renowned Comedy Cellar.Website: https://sha
 fihossaincomedy.carrd.coIG: https://www.instagram.com/shafistandsup/?hl=en
 Sarah Adelman is a born and bred New Yorker\, stand up comic\, and screenw
 riter (and former scientist). As a stand-up\, she’s a regular at New Yor
 k Comedy Club\, Union Hall\, DontTellComedy — and tours nationally.&nbsp
 \; She is the creator\, host\, and EP of “BLOW MY MIND\,” an original 
 social series with 50M+ views. In each episode\, she sits down with a gues
 t as they present her with a mind-blowing science fact. The show was featu
 red in the New York Times. She also regularly teaches science communicatio
 n courses at universities!&nbsp\;Website: https://www.sarahadelmancomedy.c
 omIG: https://www.instagram.com/sarahadelman1/Luke Strathmann runs the com
 munications team at Yale’s Department of Economics\, where he’s Editor
 -in-Chief of the Yale Economics Magazine. He’s previously worked for MIT
  and Princeton’s economics departments\, the World Bank\, more UN agenci
 es than he can remember\, Omidyar Network\, and the AI Now Institute. His 
 humor writing has appeared in The New Yorker and McSweeney’s\, and he pe
 rforms comedy at clubs all around NYC. He is the host of EconLOL\, the wor
 ld's first\, best\, and only live economics-themed comedy show.Website: ht
 tps://www.lukestrathmann.comIG: https://www.instagram.com/lstrathm/?hl=enT
 he evening flow:&nbsp\;7:30pm - Doors open\, grab a drink get settled and 
 hangout8:00pm -&nbsp\; Show Begins and we laugh a lot9:15pm - Show ends bu
 t we hangout at the space and laugh some more10:00pm - Goodnight new frien
 ds!What Is an Olio?Think Olio is an ongoing experiment in lifelong learnin
 g. We are a community of open-minded people who gather to exchange ideas w
 ith new friends and connect over art\, literature\, and philosophy.Check o
 ut our full calendarOur $30 membership gives you two events for the price 
 of one!&nbsp\;An Olio is what we call the social learning events we’ve b
 een organizing since 2015. A blend between a lecture and a house party\, O
 lios are led by a teacher who loves sharing their passions and the room is
  filled with curious\, open-minded New Yorkers.&nbsp\;Our goal is to spark
  new perspectives\, ignite curiosity\, and enjoy ourselves socially offeri
 ng an alternative to typical nightlife options.Disclaimer: By purchasing a
  ticket\, you agree to have your photo/video used for social media/marketi
 ng materials. If you prefer to not have your photo taken\, feel free to se
 nd us a note.Photo by Zhi-Da Zhong\n\nTickets & info: https://www.viewcy.c
 om/event/powerpoint_comedy_clu
URL:https://www.viewcy.com/event/powerpoint_comedy_clu
