SUMMARY:OlioTrip Guatemala: From Antigua to Lake Atitlán
DESCRIPTION:OlioTrips are open to everyone and we foster the spirit of mean
 ingful connections\, new experiences and a space where you can be at ease.
  Think family vacation but with a chosen family (and without the bickering
  😂).&nbsp\;Click here for the full description of the trip.Flow of the 
 trip: Antigua - Jan 15 - 19thThis time\, we're settling into a gorgeous ho
 me in Antigua for the first half of the trip. Days are for workshops at ou
 r friend’s artist residency\, chef-prepared meals in a local architect
 ’s orchid garden\, or wandering the dreamy streets of this UNESCO-listed
  town\; nights are for inviting artists and locals over for dinners\, danc
 ing\, renting out the local movie theater\, salons\, and intimate house co
 ncerts.Lake Atitlan - Jan 19th - 22ndThen we move to the lake\, where the 
 pace slows even further. Some of us will relax and take it all in\; others
  will join a sunrise hike or a cooking workshop. Either way\, we'll share 
 meals\, play games\, and make a new group of best friends before heading h
 ome restored.Selfishly\, we can't wait to go back and we can't wait to sha
 re this world with you: swimming through the heat of the day\, visiting ou
 r friends' studios and restaurants\, and basking in new friendships as art
 ists and teachers we love come to us for house concerts and shared meals.W
 e've built this trip to move slowly so that we come home recharged and ins
 pired.&nbsp\;Some highlights to expect:Ridiculously good coffee&nbsp\;Cour
 tyard breakfasts in AntiguaPlenty of free time to wander the shops\, cafes
  and restaurantsPottery and weaving workshop at Red MateriaGuided conversa
 tions that help us contextualize and process our new learningsLakefront ac
 commodations in AtitlanVolcano views and optional volcano hikeOptional sun
 rise hikeLake kayaking&nbsp\;Full price for the 8 day trip: Shared Room: $
 2\,450Duo: $4\,700 / pair ($2\,350 each)Private Room: $3\,050$500 deposit 
 to reserve your spot!Balance to be paid in full by Dec 1.Reach out for pay
 ment plan options. Included:Accommodations (7 nights)All breakfasts + 5 ad
 ditional mealsMajority of workshops\, tours\, and activitiesTransportation
  to/from activitiesTips for drivers &amp\; guides Not Included:Flights to/
 from GuatemalaMeals not listedTravel insurancePersonal expenses---How room
 ing works:Shared Room ($2\,750) — You'll room with another Olio traveler
 . If you're coming solo\, we'll match you thoughtfully (most of our travel
 ers come this way).Private Room ($3\,350) — Your own room for the whole 
 trip\, subject to availability.Duo ($5\,300 for two\, or $2\,650/person) 
 — Coming with a friend or partner? Book together and each save $100 off 
 the shared rate. We’ll have options to share a bed or to have separate b
 eds in a shared room.Room availability at both properties is limited\, so 
 we recommend booking early\, especially if you're set on a private room.\n
 \nTickets & info: https://www.viewcy.com/event/oliotrip_guatemala_o
